+| `xnu/fuxi-wlan/fuxi_wlan.c` | `6d0465f9df8bee29c75c85952451f7f6310dcbef1e45a2b707c639b71ec15de3` |
+| `tools/test-fuxi-wlan-w18.py` | `4a82f8cdfa784e53c0c159f203e7b654520658977132c723fbecf66bd9f3b2e6` |
